00:37:16.380 --> 00:37:19.400
So, I mean, yeah, I was also kind of cheesing it.

00:37:20.200 --> 00:37:26.860
I guess it wasn't just also using the, the, the min max loadout.

00:37:27.340 --> 00:37:33.800
I keep using loadout when I should just be saying like the, the array of units that you have.

00:37:34.120 --> 00:37:43.040
