00:38:36.460 --> 00:38:38.120
Another level of that rock, paper, scissors.

00:38:38.520 --> 00:38:46.960
I mean, I agree only so far that like, whether or not there were a bunch of rivers in Africa, I mean, there's at least one.

00:38:47.400 --> 00:38:48.220
Which is debatable.

00:38:48.560 --> 00:38:49.960
Right, right. It's debatable. How many rivers?

