00:39:24.240 --> 00:39:39.560
And my, like the thing that I keep bringing up and we keep both bringing up is I would just like to see more in terms of the map and adding rivers, whether it's realistic or not, would add a bit more complexity and a little bit more to think about on each turn.

00:39:40.020 --> 00:39:45.260
Uh, if there was just a better variety of, of landscape.

